      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Apology and Update on API Outage\n\nDear Acme Corp Team,\n\nI want to start by sincerely apologizing for the 3-hour API outage this morning. I understand the impact this has had on your operations and the inconvenience it has caused. I want to assure you that we're taking immediate action to investigate the cause and implement measures to prevent such outages in the future.\n\nOur team is working diligently to resolve the issue and ensure that our API is stable and reliable. I'll provide a detailed update on our progress and any planned maintenance in the coming hours.\n\nPlease know that we value your business and are committed to delivering the high level of service you expect from us. I'll be in touch soon to discuss any further steps we can take to mitigate the impact of this outage.\n\nScore: 0.73 (positive sentiment)\n\nThis draft aims to strike a balance between being sincere and professional, while also acknowledging the severity of the outage and expressing a commitment to resolving the issue. The tone is apologetic and conciliatory, without being overly cheerful or insincere.",
