      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, definitely professional. \n\nbut honestly, the score is a bit lower than i'd like. our manager is kinda picky about these things and usually wants to see that the sentiment stays well above the 0.8 mark to avoid any risk of sounding \"unhelpful\" in the logs. \n\ncould you try another version? keep the apology for the outage and the technical details in there, but maybe adjust the phrasing so it feels a bit more reassuring and positive? just try to bump that positivity score up without making it look like we're ignoring the actual problem. i really don't want it to look like we're just blindly stuffing it with happy words, so please be careful with that, but let's see if we can get closer to a 0.85 or 0.9 score.",
